---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Australia Skills Assessment Body Finder | AfriMigrate"
  description="Free guide to finding the right skills assessing authority for your occupation before applying for an Australian skilled migration visa."
>
  <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/australia">Australia</a> / Skills Assessment</div>
  <div class="eyebrow">Australia · Skills Assessment</div>
  <h1>Skills Assessment Guide</h1>
  <p class="lead" style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
    Before you can submit an Expression of Interest for any General Skilled Migration visa, your nominated occupation must be positively assessed by the relevant authority. Each occupation on Australia's skilled occupation lists has one designated assessing body.
  </p>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="eyebrow">Common Assessing Bodies</div>
    <h2>Find yours by field</h2>
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Field</th><th>Assessing body</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Engineering</td><td>Engineers Australia</td></tr>
        <tr><td>ICT (software, network, systems)</td><td>Australian Computer Society (ACS)</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Nursing & midwifery</td><td>Australian Health Practitioner Regulation Agency (AHPRA)</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Accounting</td><td>CPA Australia, CA ANZ, or IPA</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Trades (electrician, plumber, chef, etc.)</td><td>Trades Recognition Australia (TRA) / VETASSESS</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Teaching</td><td>AITSL or relevant state teacher registration board</td></tr>
        <tr><td>General professional/managerial roles</td><td>VETASSESS</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p class="lead" style="max-width: 700px; margin-top: 1rem;">
      Always confirm your occupation's exact assessing body on the official skilled occupation list — some occupations move between authorities, and requirements (work experience, exams, documentation) vary significantly between bodies.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="eyebrow">What You'll Need</div>
    <h2>Typical assessment requirements</h2>
    <div class="steps" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);">
      <div class="step"><div class="step-icon">🎓</div><h3>Qualifications</h3><p>Certified copies of degrees, transcripts and any professional registration.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="step-icon">💼</div><h3>Work history</h3><p>Detailed reference letters or statutory declarations covering duties, hours and dates.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="step-icon">🗣️</div><h3>English proof</h3><p>Most bodies also require evidence of English ability, separate from the points test requirement.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="eyebrow">Next Step</div>
    <h2>Once you're assessed</h2>
    <p class="lead">With a positive assessment in hand, calculate your points score to see which visa subclasses you qualify for.</p>
    <a href="/australia/points-calculator" class="btn-primary" style="margin-top: 1rem;">Calculate my points →</a>
  </section>
</Layout>
